<BaseLayout
  title="US taxes and social security for Americans in Italy"
  description="The US taxes citizens on worldwide income wherever they live. The FEIE, the foreign tax credit, FBAR and Form 8938, the treaty's saving clause, the unusual US–Italy totalization rule, and why Medicare stops at the border."
